 "strings": [
  "",
  "The battle for Solomon",
  "raged on.",
  "It was a fierce battle.",
  "The Solar Ray System, a new",
  "weapon, applied the simple principle",
  "of burning paper with a magnifying",
  "glass over thousands of km.",
  "Yet even after it burned Solomon,",
  "the battle raged on, fiercer still.",
  "Both sides now matched relative",
  "speeds and simply slugged it out.",
  "Not only Solomon, but the fleet",
  "garrisoned there was thrown in,",
  "and the battle was no longer just",
  "about storming a fortress.",
  "Even when Tianem, commanding",
  "the Federation's Third Fleet, fell,",
  "even when Dozle left command",
  "to fight as a lone soldier,",
  "the battle showed",
  "no sign of ending.",
  "Now it was nothing more than",
  "a brawl until one side",
  "fell silent or ran.",
  "This battle, seemingly endless,",
  "was nevertheless about",
  "to come to an end.",
  "The end came from the Zeon side.",
  "Vice Admiral Dozle, leading Zeon,",
  "sallied out so that his child, his",
  "wife and his men might live.",
  "Had he instead fought a quagmire",
  "battle for every block to the last,",
  "Zeon, though unable to win,",
  "might have managed to",
  "wipe out the Third Fleet.",
  "And yet,",
  "Dozle did not do that.",
  "In defeat,",
  "he chose the way that would let",
  "at least a few people live.",
  "On this, most historians",
  "side with Dozle.",
  "In truth, ordering a fight until",
  "annihilation is madness, for a",
  "nation and for a general alike,",
  "and Dozle, who gave",
  "no such order, can be said",
  "to have held, for all his looks,",
  "quite sensible views:",
  "such, at least,",
  "is the general view.",
  "Perhaps that is as it should be.",
  "War is one means of diplomacy.",
  "Wipe out the other side,",
  "and there is no diplomacy left.",
  "Mirai and\n   Sleggar",
  "Amuro and\n   Fraw",
  "Mirai and Sleggar",
  "Mirai, of course, is the woman",
  "who, later in this era,",
  "would become the wife",
  "of Bright Noa.",
  "Naturally, many think she and",
  "Bright were lovers even then.",
  "In fact, it was a little different.",
  "This woman, Kamaran her fiance",
  "included, was popular only with",
  "men who wanted to be coddled.",
  "But.",
  "Mirai,",
  "though she felt love for Bright,",
  "was not quite used to Bright's",
  "habit of leaning on her.",
  "She was young; she surely wanted",
  "to lean, rather than be leaned on.",
  "On this point, Bright was",
  "selfishness itself, walking around",
  "in clothes.",
  "In fact, the man she loved",
  "was the new Lieutenant Sleggar.",
  "The two seldom met face to face;",
  "if anything, they barely knew",
  "each other at all.",
  "Which may be exactly",
  "why they were drawn",
  "to each other.",
  "If you know someone too well,",
  "perhaps you cannot fall in love.",
  "What must Bright have felt",
  "watching the two of them?",
  "His whole life long, he said",
  "nothing at all about this time.",
  "Amuro and Fraw",
  "Around this time, the bond",
  "between Fraw and Amuro",
  "was coming to an end.",
  "They had never really been lovers,",
  "but Amuro was leaving Fraw, who",
  "knew him better than his parents,",
  "behind, and was about",
  "to set out on the path",
  "of a lonely hero.",
  "Even so,",
  "Fraw was making an effort.",
  "And there were people who",
  "tried to cheer her on.",
  "White Base",
  "Fraw",
  "\"Amu...\"",
  "Hayato",
  "\"Why not just",
  " call out to him?\"",
  "\"I can't.\"",
  "\"He's a pushover.",
  " If you just call out to him...\"",
  "\"I can't. I just can't...",
  " Amuro... isn't the Amuro",
  " I know anymore.\"",
  "\"That's not...\"",
  "\"He's shooting down so many.",
  " He's fighting so hard.\"",
  "\"But he's the same as ever.\"",
  "\"No, he isn't... he isn't.",
  " I'm scared...\"",
  "\"I used to be scared",
  " of being left behind.",
  " But now... it's different.\"",
  "\"...All right.\"",
  "\"Hm?\"",
  "\"I'll shoot down more",
  " enemies than Amuro.",
  " That'll do, won't it?\"",
  "\"Huh...?\"",
  "\"I hate it when people",
  " mope around.",
  " Especially me.\"",
  "Hayato: a man of righteous anger.",
  "Yet never once",
  "did his ability truly",
  "keep pace with his heart.",
  "In the middle of this battle,",
  "he was wounded.",
  "Marker",
  "\"The Guncannon has landed.\"",
  "\"Damage level B,",
  " and the pilot is wounded.\"",
  "\"With the Guncannon",
  " pulled back, our strength",
  " has dropped 11 percent.\"",
  "\"Hayato was hurt?\"",
  "\"There seem to be more wounded.",
  " Please let me go and help",
  " the medical team.\"",
  "Bright",
  "\"All right.\"",
  "\"Someone take over for Fraw.\"",
  "Federation Soldier",
  "\"Yes, sir, I'll take over.\"",
  "\"It's my fault, it's my fault...\"",
  "Doctor",
  "\"Listen, Hayato gets one more",
  " transfusion. Don't forget, okay?\"",
  "\"Yes, sir.\"",
  "\"Ugh... it's c-coming.",
  " A D-Dom...\"",
  "\"Huh? ...Fraw Bow.\"",
  "\"Stay quiet, now.",
  " You fought more than enough.",
  " It's all right to rest now.\"",
  "\"What about everyone?\"",
  "\"They're safe. Your battle",
  " is over now.\"",
  "\"Is... that so.\"",
  "\"It's s-so frustrating,",
  " being the only one like this.\"",
  "\"I can't measure up to Sayla-san",
  " or to Kai-san either.",
  " I-I'm pathetic.\"",
  "\"What are you saying, Hayato?",
  " You did splendidly too.\"",
  "\"Stop it. I don't need",
  " words of comfort.\"",
  "\"E-Even a guy like me, you know,",
  " ever since I came aboard",
  " White Base...\"",
  "\"I wanted to beat Amuro,",
  " I kept wanting to beat him,",
  " and now look at me.\"",
  "\"Hayato.",
  " Amuro is different. He is.",
  " He isn't like the rest of us.\"",
  "Fraw's words were",
  "words meant for herself.",
  "'He isn't like us.'",
  "That was the conclusion",
  "she drew about Amuro, who had",
  "kept on fighting to protect her.",
  "A terribly sad conclusion.",
  "As if running away,",
  "she would come to open",
  "her heart to Hayato.",
  "Carrying the feelings of many,",
  "the battle of Solomon went on.",
  "Solomon's strength was",
  "already spent, and the battle",
  "had entered its final stage.",
  "Mirai",
  "\"...Tell me it's a lie...",
  " You can't say it's a lie, can you?",
  " Amuro...\"",
  "For some time after",
  "Mirai heard from Amuro",
  "that Sleggar had been killed,",
  "Bright did not lay eyes",
  "on Mirai.",
  "Watching her,",
  "speaking to her --",
  "he could do neither.",
  "He only prayed briefly in silence.",
  "Zeon, too, prayed in silence.",
  "They came from those",
  "Dozle had left behind.",
  "Gwazine",
  "Zeon Soldier",
  "\"It's one of our escape rockets.\"",
  "M'Quve",
  "\"Its course?\"",
  "\"It appears to have been",
  " launched from Solomon.\"",
  "Barom",
  "\"Recover it by remote control.\"",
  "\"Colonel, the fighting at Solomon",
  " seems to be grave.\"",
  "\"Sir?\"",
  "\"Never mind some escape rocket--\"",
  "\"With respect, Colonel M'Quve,",
  " you do not understand the hearts",
  " of soldiers in space.\"",
  "\"I don't?\"",
  "\"At times like this,",
  " they believe their comrades",
  " will come to rescue them.\"",
  "\"That is why soldiers",
  " can fight even in space,",
  " with death always at their side.\"",
  "\"It'll leave recovery range soon!\"",
  "\"...Very well. Recover it.\"",
  "Zenna",
  "\"...\"",
  "\"Mineva, it's our own fleet.",
  " ...We're saved.\"",
  "\"We have brought Lady Zenna.\"",
  "\"They say Solomon has fallen.\"",
  "\"Ahh...\"",
  "\"How about this?",
  " Colonel, take Lady Zenna",
  " to Granada in this Gwazine.\"",
  "\"I'll move to the Chivvay",
  " and watch what the Federation",
  " does from here on.\"",
  "\"Yes, sir. It does seem too late",
  " now to launch a surprise attack.\"",
  "\"Indeed. You were only ever",
  " the operations officer for the",
  " case where Solomon held out.\"",
  "\"I will leave ships to gather",
  " intel and rescue escapees.\"",
  "Moved by Mineva's crying,",
  "M'Quve did something even he",
  "thought was unlike him.",
  "To the staff officer,",
  "he said this:",
  "\"Very well.",
  " I will take on that duty too.\"",
  "Those were his words."
